    <div class="supporting-content">
    <section class="price-section shell" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="price-title">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="price-title">What will it cost?</h2>
      <div class="price-copy"><p>Tell us a little about the job. We’ll help work out what’s involved and get back to you about the price.</p><p class="supporting">What’s already in your home, and where the new equipment will go, can make a real difference.</p><a class="text-link" href="#questions">Tell us what you’re planning <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section shell" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 class="section-title" id="services-title">Electrical work for your home.</h2><p>Generators, EV chargers, and panel upgrades. Tell us what you’re planning and we’ll help work out what the job needs.</p></div>
      <div class="service-list">
        <article class="service-entry" id="ev-chargers">
          <div><img class="service-image" src="/images/ev-charging.jpg" alt="Illustrative home EV charging station" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><h3>EV chargers</h3><p>Charge your car at home. We’ll assess your panel capacity and work out where to install the charger.</p><details><summary>What affects the work?</summary><div class="detail-copy"><p>The charger location, distance from the panel, wiring route, and available electrical capacity all affect the work.</p><p>You don’t have to know which charger you need before you get in touch.</p><a href="/ev-charger-installation.html">More about EV charger installation →</a></div></details><a class="module-link" href="#questions">Tell us about your installation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="service-entry" id="generators">
          <div><img class="service-image" src="/images/generator.jpg" alt="Illustrative standby generator beside a house" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><h3>Generators</h3><p>Keep power to the things you need when an outage hits. We install whole-house generators and portable generator hookups.</p><details><summary>Which setup do you need?</summary><div class="detail-copy"><p>A portable generator hookup and an automatic standby system are different projects. The equipment, location, fuel supply, and circuits you want backed up matter.</p><a href="/generators.html">Compare generator options →</a></div></details><a class="module-link" href="#questions">Tell us what you want to back up <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="service-entry" id="panels">
          <div><img class="service-image" src="/images/panel.jpg" alt="Illustrative residential electrical panel" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"><h3>Panel upgrades</h3><p>Replacing a problem panel or adding new electrical equipment? We’ll check what you have and work out what you need.</p><details><summary>Do you need more capacity?</summary><div class="detail-copy"><p>What you already have, what you’re adding, and any changes needed to the electrical service determine the scope.</p><p>Adding an EV charger doesn’t always mean you need a service upgrade. We can look at load management options, too.</p><a href="/electrical-panel-upgrade.html">More about panel upgrades →</a></div></details><a class="module-link" href="#questions">Tell us what you want to change <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="residential-row"><div><h3>And the other jobs around your home.</h3><p>Lighting, outlets, ceiling fans, whole-house surge protection, and wiring for hot tubs and saunas.</p><a class="text-link" href="/residential-electrical.html">Residential electrical services →</a></div><div><h3>Something stopped working?</h3><p>We handle troubleshooting, repairs, and service calls, too.</p><a class="text-link" href="#questions">Tell us what’s happening <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section shell" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div><p class="section-label">Bremray Electrical</p><h2 class="section-title" id="about-title">Here in Ann Arbor.</h2></div>
      <div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">We’ve served Ann Arbor since 2004. We’ll talk through the work with you and answer your questions before we get started.</p><p>You don’t have to know which charger, generator, or panel you need before you call. Tell us what you’re trying to do. We’ll talk through the electrical side with you.</p><dl class="business-details"><div><dt>Where we work</dt><dd><a href="/locations/ann-arbor-electrician.html">Ann Arbor</a> and Washtenaw County, including <a href="/locations/ypsilanti-electrician.html">Ypsilanti</a>, <a href="/locations/chelsea-electrician.html">Chelsea</a>, <a href="/locations/saline-electrician.html">Saline</a>, Dexter, and Pittsfield Township.</dd></div><div><dt>When to reach us</dt><dd>Monday–Friday, 8am–5pm</dd></div></dl></div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section shell" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title">Before you get in touch.</h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can you help with smaller electrical jobs?</summary><p>Yes. Residential services include outlets, lighting, troubleshooting, and repairs, alongside larger installation projects.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a panel upgrade for an EV charger?</summary><p>It depends on your existing electrical service and charging requirements. We’ll assess your panel and planned charger before recommending the work.</p></details><details><summary>What should I include in my request?</summary><p>Your town, how to reach you, and a short description of the project or problem are a useful starting point.</p></details></div></section>
    </div>
  </main>
